# Keyboard layout for neighboring key suggestions (Kedmanee)
KEY ๅ/_ภ|ภ/ๅถ|ถ/ภุ|ุ/ถึ|ึ/ุค|ค/ึต|ต/คจ|จ/ตข|ข/จช|ช/ขๆ|ๆ/ชไ|ไ/ๆำ|ำ/ไพ|พ/ำะ|ะ/พั|ั/ะี|ี/ัร|ร/ีน|น/รย|ย/นบ|บ/ยล|ล/บฃ|ฃ/ลฅ|ฟ/หฤ|ห/ฟก|ก/หด|ด/กเ|เ/ด้|้/เ่|่/้า|า/่ส|ส/าว|ว/สง|ง/ว.|ผ/ปแ|ป/ผอ|อ/ปิ|ิ/อื|ื/ิท|ท/ื

# Input Conversion (ICONV)
# Automatically fix common typing order errors (e.g. Tone Mark before Vowel -> Vowel before Tone)
# This allows Hunspell to 'see' the correct word even if typed slightly wrong.
ICONV 5
ICONV ็่ ่็
ICONV ็้ ้็
ICONV ็๊ ๊็
ICONV ็๋ ๋็
ICONV ํา ำ

# Breaking characters
# Define characters that break words (punctuations, numbers, zero-width space)
BREAK 10
BREAK -
BREAK ^
BREAK $
BREAK *
BREAK %
BREAK _
BREAK 1
BREAK 2
BREAK 3
BREAK .

